{"overview":"داستان این انیمیشن در مورد زندگی روزمره یک خانواده ژاپنی به نام «یامادا» است. زندگی روزمره‌ای که اتفاقات زیادی را شامل می‌شود؛ از گم‌شدن یک کودک در فروشگاه گرفته تا روابط بین پدر و پسر، زن و شوهر، و ماجرای اولین دوست دختر-پسر خانواده که با طنزی شیرین و درعین‌حال باورپذیر تعریف می‌شود ...","tagline":"","overview_en":"The Yamadas are a typical middle class Japanese family in urban Tokyo and this film shows us a variety of episodes of their lives. With tales that range from the humorous to the heartbreaking, we see this family cope with life's little conflicts, problems, and joys in their own way.","tagline_en":"The ups and downs of life.","runtime":104,"status":"Released","seasons":[],"episodes":null,"crew":["ایسائو تاکاهاتا"],"crew_en":["Isao Takahata"],"countries":["JP"],"cast":[{"name":"Hayato Isohata","role":"Noboru Yamada (voice)","photo":""},{"name":"荒木雅子","role":"Shige Yamano (voice)","photo":"","en":"Masako Araki"},{"name":"宇野なおみ","role":"Nonoko Yamada (voice)","photo":"","en":"Naomi Uno"},{"name":"益岡徹","role":"Takashi Yamada (voice)","photo":"/rvgRRIsXvWylqXHDWnffXay2iCK.jpg","en":"Toru Masuoka"},{"name":"朝丘雪路","role":"Matsuko Yamada (voice)","photo":"/kMRHuPRMDGWXlxndfMjHWdD4IRu.jpg","en":"Yukiji Asaoka"},{"name":"矢野顕子","role":"Teacher Fujihara (voice)","photo":"/hvxKBkHN0ycCRR5agukqq0bgldL.jpg","en":"Akiko Yano"},{"name":"Kosanji Yanagiya","role":"Haiku Reader (voice)","photo":""},{"name":"中村玉緒","role":"Shige's Friend (voice)","photo":"/nTmZNzPVlP1utUe66WkRgC5xd3w.jpg","en":"Tamao Nakamura"},{"name":"ミヤコ蝶々","role":"Grandma Kikuchi (voice)","photo":"/Yoo6CdPyXDjupyaQVm2oPZZJGP.jpg","en":"Chōchō Miyako"},{"name":"江川卓","role":"Baseball Commentator on Television (voice)","photo":"/5Pqqamg9la6X6UOKX2iQjmplm6v.jpg","en":"Suguru Egawa"}],"trailer":"oJD0k7hWc6M","watch":{"US":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/16198/watch?locale=US","p":[{"n":"HBO Max Amazon Channel","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/64fLWeSyZ1KQZhIdvTdy4QHeWty.png"},{"n":"HBO Max","ki